    "font size" : 9.2,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "adjustment of 1.5 per cent. He also said that a new concept model was under way; this model will address the redeployment and employment of SANDF members who have reached the brink of their careers."
